      "content": {
        "text": "Chair\u2019s Blog: March Board Workshop and ICANN85 Recap\nOn behalf of the ICANN Board of Directors, I would like to thank everyone who took part in the ICANN85 Community Forum in Mumbai, India. ICANN85 came at a busy and consequential time for ICANN, as our last Public Meeting before the launch of the New Generic Top-Level Domains (gTLD) Program: 2026 Round. Click the title to read more from Tripti Sinha, ICANN Board Chair.",
